# Project intentions

Before expanding scope, read and follow [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md).

## Stay in v1

Allowed: Series construction, slice/filter, align/merge, fill/DropNA, resample, rolling, arithmetic, lag/diff/pct_change, interpolate.

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- Multi-column DataFrame APIs
- CSV/JSON I/O
- Plotting
- OHLC bars
- Business calendars

## Preserve invariants

- UTC times, strictly ascending, unique
- Equal length of times and values
- `math.NaN()` marks missing float64 values
- Resample buckets are `[t, t+d)`
- Public ops return new series; do not mutate caller data

## Optimize as you implement

Correctness first, then cost: linear scans, shared time indexes, no extra copies. See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).
